---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { knowledgeGraph } from '../lib/graph';
const graph = await knowledgeGraph();
---
<Base title="知识图谱" description="沿着文章与核心概念之间的联系，探索 Evinci 的公开笔记。">
  <section class="graph-page" aria-labelledby="graph-title">
    <header class="graph-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECT THE NOTES</p><h1 id="graph-title">知识图谱</h1><p>从文章出发，沿着概念寻找联系。</p></div><div class="graph-stats"><span><b>{graph.articleCount}</b> 篇文章</span><span><b>{graph.conceptCount}</b> 个概念</span></div></header>
    <div class="graph-toolbar"><label>搜索文章或概念 <input id="graph-search" type="search" placeholder="输入关键词" disabled={!graph.articleCount} /></label><div class="graph-buttons"><button type="button" id="graph-in" disabled={!graph.articleCount} aria-label="放大图谱">＋</button><button type="button" id="graph-out" disabled={!graph.articleCount} aria-label="缩小图谱">－</button><button type="button" id="graph-reset" disabled={!graph.articleCount}>复位</button></div></div>
    <div class="graph-workspace"><div class="graph-canvas">
      {graph.articleCount ? <svg id="knowledge-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 760" aria-label="文章与概念关系图，支持拖动和缩放"></svg> : <div class="graph-empty"><span class="empty-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>第一条线索，从第一篇文章开始。</h2><p>这里还没有公开文章。文章发布后，DeepSeek 会提取有正文依据的概念，逐渐连接出知识网络。</p><a href="/posts/">前往文章页 →</a></div>}
      <div class="graph-legend"><span><i class="article-dot"></i>文章</span><span><i class="concept-dot"></i>概念</span><span>实线：正文提及 · 虚线：共享概念</span></div>
    </div><aside class="graph-detail" aria-live="polite"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW A CONNECTION</p><h2 id="graph-selection-title">从一个节点开始</h2><p id="graph-selection-description">点击文章或概念，查看摘要、正文依据和相关内容。也可以通过下方列表阅读文章。</p><a id="graph-selection-link" hidden>阅读原文 ↗</a><ul id="graph-selection-evidence"></ul></aside></div>
    {graph.pendingCount > 0 && <p class="graph-notice">{graph.pendingCount} 篇文章等待概念解析，目前仅显示文章节点。</p>}
    <p class="graph-help">拖动空白处移动视图，拖动节点调整位置；滚轮或按钮缩放。键盘可聚焦节点，按回车查看详情，Esc 清除选择。共享概念只表示阅读线索，不代表观点一致或因果关系。</p>
    {graph.articleCount > 0 && <section class="graph-reading"><h2>按文章阅读</h2><ul>{graph.nodes.filter(node => node.type === 'article').map(node => <li><a href={node.href}>{node.label}</a><span>{node.description}</span></li>)}</ul></section>}
    <noscript><p>互动图谱需要 JavaScript；文章仍可通过文章页和上方阅读列表访问。</p></noscript>
    <script id="knowledge-data" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify(graph).replace(/</g, '\\u003c')} />
  </section>
</Base>
<script>
  import '../scripts/knowledge-graph';
</script>
